WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.540 line:72%
First, you write a program once
as one clear blueprint,

2
00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:07.020 line:72%
and the computer generates
matching code across languages.

3
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:11.566 line:72%
Second, every possible input
must have a declared outcome up
front,

4
00:00:11.566 --> 00:00:14.503 line:72%
preventing hidden crashes before
anything runs.

5
00:00:14.863 --> 00:00:19.017 line:72%
Third, every repair that passes
the checker is saved and reused,

6
00:00:19.017 --> 00:00:21.289 line:72%
so you never pay twice for one
fix.
